{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-job-21-1","title":"Job 21:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Job shews that even in the judgment of man he has reason to be grieved. 7 Sometimes the wicked prosper, though they despise God. 16 Sometimes their destruction is manifest. 21 The happy and unhappy are alike in death. 27 The judgment of the wicked is in another world.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-2","title":"Job 21:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Hear. 13:3,4; 18:2; 33:1,31-33; 34:2; Jud 9:7; Isa 55:2; Heb 2:1 let this be. 15:11; 16:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-3","title":"Job 21:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>that I may. 13:13; 33:31-33 mock on. 12:4,5; 13:9; 16:10,20; 17:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-4","title":"Job 21:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>is my complaint. 7:11-21; 10:1,2; 1Sa 1:16; Ps 22:1-3; 77:3-9; 102:1; *title Ps 142:2,3; Mt 26:38 if it were. 2Ki 6:26,27; Ps 42:11 troubled. Heb. shortened. Ex 6:9; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-5","title":"Job 21:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Mark me. Heb. Look unto me. be astonished. 2:12; 17:8; 19:20,21 lay your. 29:9; 40:4; Jud 18:19; Ps 39:9; Pr 30:32; Am 5:13; Mic 7:16 Ro 11:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-6","title":"Job 21:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Even when. Ps 77:3; 88:15; 119:120; La 3:19,20; Hab 3:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-7","title":"Job 21:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Wherefore. 12:6; Ps 17:10; 73:3-12; Jer 12:1-3; Hab 1:15,16 mighty. Ps 37:35; Da 4:17; Re 13:2-7; 17:2-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-8","title":"Job 21:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>5:3,4; 18:19; 20:10,28; Pr 17:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-9","title":"Job 21:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>safe from fear. Heb. peace from fear. 15:21; 18:11; Ps 73:19; Isa 57:19-21 the rod. 9:34; Ps 73:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-10","title":"Job 21:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>their cow. Ex 23:26; De 7:13,14; 28:11; Ps 144:13,14; Ec 9:1,2; Lu 12:16-21 Lu 16:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-11","title":"Job 21:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Ps 107:41; 127:3-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-12","title":"Job 21:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Ge 4:21; 31:27; Isa 5:12; 22:13; Am 6:4-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-13","title":"Job 21:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>They. 36:11; Ps 73:4; Mt 24:38,39; Lu 12:19,20; 17:28,29 wealth. or, mirth.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-14","title":"Job 21:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>they say. 22:17; Ps 10:4,11; Lu 8:28,37; Hab 1:15; Joh 15:23,24; Ro 8:7 for we. Pr 1:7,22,29; Joh 3:19,20; 8:45-47; Ro 1:28; 2Th 2:10-12 2Ti 4:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-15","title":"Job 21:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>What is. Ex 5:2; Ps 12:4; Pr 30:9; Ho 13:6 and what. 34:9; 35:3; Isa 30:11; Mal 1:13,14 if we. Isa 45:19; Mt 7:7; Joh 16:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-16","title":"Job 21:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Lo. 1:21; 12:9,10; Ps 49:6,7; 52:5-7; Ec 8:8; Lu 16:2,25 the counsel. 22:18; Ge 49:6; Ps 1:1; Pr 1:10; 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-17","title":"Job 21:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>oft. 18:5,6,18; Pr 13:9; 20:20; 24:20; Mt 25:8 candle. or, lamp. distributeth. Ps 32:10; 90:7-9; Lu 12:46; Ro 2:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-18","title":"Job 21:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>as stubble. 13:25; Ex 15:7; Ps 1:4; 35:5; 83:13; Isa 5:24; 17:13; 29:5; 40:24 Isa 41:15,16; Jer 13:24; Ho 13:3; Na 1:10; Mt 3:12 carrieth. Heb. stealeth.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-19","title":"Job 21:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>layeth. 22:24; De 32:34; Mt 6:19,20; Ro 2:5 iniquity. that is, the punishment of his iniquity. Ge 4:7; Isa 53:4-6; 2Co 5:21 for his. Ex 20:5; Ps 109:9-31; Isa 14:21; Eze 18:14,19,20; Mt 23:31-35 he rewardeth. De 32:41; 2Sa 3:39; Ps 54:5; Mt 16:27; 2Ti 4:14; Re 18:6 he shall. Mal 3:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-20","title":"Job 21:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>see. 27:19; Lu 16:23 drink. Ps 75:8; Isa 51:17; Jer 25:15,16; 51:7; Re 14:10; 19:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-21","title":"Job 21:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>For what. 14:21; Ec 2:18,19; Lu 16:27,28 the number. 14:5; Ps 55:23; 102:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-22","title":"Job 21:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>teach. 40:2; Isa 40:13,14; 45:9; Ro 11:34; 1Co 2:16 he judgeth. 34:17-19; Ps 113:5,6; Ec 5:8; Isa 40:22,23; 1Co 6:3; 2Pe 2:4 Jude 1:6; Re 20:1-3,12-15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-23","title":"Job 21:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>in his full strength. Heb. in his very perfection. or, thestrength of his perfection. 20:22,23; Ps 49:17; 73:4,5; Lu 12:19-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-24","title":"Job 21:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>His breasts. or, His milk pails. 15:27; Ps 17:10 moistened. Pr 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-25","title":"Job 21:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>in the bitterness. 3:20; 7:11; 9:18; 10:1; 2Sa 17:8; *marg: Pr 14:10; Isa 38:15-17 never. 20:23; 1Ki 17:12; Ec 6:2; Eze 4:16,17; 12:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-26","title":"Job 21:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>alike. 3:18,19; 20:11; Ec 9:2 the worms. 17:14; 19:26; Ps 49:14; Isa 14:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-27","title":"Job 21:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>I know. 4:8-11; 5:3-5; 8:3-6; 15:20-35; 20:5,29; Lu 5:22 ye wrongfully. 32:3; 42:7; Ps 59:4; 119:86; 1Pe 2:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-28","title":"Job 21:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>Where. 20:7; Ps 37:36; 52:5,6; Hab 2:9-11; Zec 5:4 dwelling places. Heb. tent of the tabernacles. Nu 16:26-34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-29","title":"Job 21:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>go by. Ps 129:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-30","title":"Job 21:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>the wicked. Pr 16:4; Na 1:2; 2Pe 2:9-17; 3:7; Jude 1:13 day. 20:28; Ps 110:5; Pr 11:4; Zep 1:15; Ro 2:5; Re 6:17 wrath. Heb. wraths.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-31","title":"Job 21:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>declare. 2Sa 12:7-12; 1Ki 21:19-24; Ps 50:21; Jer 2:33-35; Mr 6:18 Ac 24:25; Ga 2:11 repay. 19; 41:11; De 7:10; Isa 59:13; Ro 12:19; Jas 2:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-32","title":"Job 21:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>he be. Ps 49:14; Eze 32:21-32; Lu 16:22 grave. Heb. graves. remain in the tomb. Heb. watch in theheap.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-33","title":"Job 21:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>sweet. 3:17,18 every man. 30:23; Ge 3:19; Ec 1:4; 8:8; 12:7; Heb 9:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-21-34","title":"Job 21:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>comfort. 16:2 seeing. 13:4; 32:3; 42:7 falsehood. Heb. transgression.</p>"}]}